<title>HONG KONG: Cho Hung Bank mandates US$200 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Cho Hung Bank mandates US$200 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cho Hung Bank has mandated Citicorp International and Fuji International Finance to arrange a US$200 million floating rate note issue, bankers said Monday.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of three years with no put or call options.</p>
<p>The issue will be priced at par to float at 20 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Management fees are 10 basis points.</p>
<p>General syndication is expected to begin within the next serveral days.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
